<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/julius-caesar"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Julius%20Caesar.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Julius Caesar</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">He crosses the Rubicon with a single legion in response to the Senate's final decree, igniting civil war</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-alesia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Alesia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Alesia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Caesar crosses the Rubicon, beginning the Roman Civil War</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-thapsus"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Thapsus.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Thapsus</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Caesar crosses the Rubicon with the 13th Legion and the last civil war of the Republic begins</span></li></ul></section>
